WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.268
"There was a big train crash," Roxy thought.

2
00:00:06.268 --> 00:00:08.745
"I have to help!"

3
00:00:08.745 --> 00:00:12.888
Roxy ran back to her friends.

4
00:00:12.889 --> 00:00:14.682
"I'll be right back, guys.

5
00:00:14.682 --> 00:00:20.863
I want to go see the, um, crocodiles one more time!"

6
00:00:20.863 --> 00:00:24.489
"Wait!" called Jack as Roxy ran off.

7
00:00:24.490 --> 00:00:28.080
"We'll come too. I love crocodiles!"

8
00:00:28.081 --> 00:00:31.567
But Roxy was already gone.

9
00:00:31.568 --> 00:00:34.005
Mara pointed at the sky.

10
00:00:34.005 --> 00:00:37.757
"Look! It's Rocket Girl!"

11
00:00:37.758 --> 00:00:42.841
*** Roxy flew over the train tracks until she reached the scene of the

12
00:00:42.842 --> 00:00:45.006
crash. It was a huge

13
00:00:45.006 --> 00:00:48.043
mess. Cars from the two trains were jumbled

14
00:00:48.043 --> 00:00:51.915
together. Strange smoke poured from some cars and filled the

15
00:00:51.915 --> 00:00:55.206
air. Zoo animals were running in every

16
00:00:55.207 --> 00:00:59.009
direction. Police officers and a zookeeper were trying to catch

17
00:00:59.016 --> 00:01:02.282
them. Rocket Girl landed next to Detective

18
00:01:02.282 --> 00:01:07.260
Smith. "Is there trouble with your train set, Detective?" she

19
00:01:07.260 --> 00:01:11.022
asked. "Ha-ha." Detective Smith pretended to

20
00:01:11.022 --> 00:01:14.384
laugh. "This is no time for jokes, Rocket

21
00:01:14.384 --> 00:01:16.660
Girl." "I know," said

22
00:01:16.660 --> 00:01:18.986
Roxy. "Was anybody

23
00:01:18.986 --> 00:01:21.293
hurt?" Detective Smith shook his

24
00:01:21.293 --> 00:01:24.576
head. "Luckily no people or animals were

25
00:01:24.576 --> 00:01:27.839
hurt. But now the animals are

26
00:01:27.839 --> 00:01:33.961
escaping." He coughed. "And this smoke is

27
00:01:33.961 --> 00:01:37.193
terrible. The firefighters can't get rid of

28
00:01:37.193 --> 00:01:39.095
it." Roxy looked

29
00:01:39.096 --> 00:01:42.937
around. Two firefighters were spraying the train cars with a hose.

30
00:01:42.937 --> 00:01:46.117
But the smoke was still thick.

31
00:01:46.117 --> 00:01:48.422
Roxy took a deep breath.

32
00:01:48.422 --> 00:01:52.834
Then she blew as hard as she could. Whoosh!

33
00:01:52.834 --> 00:01:57.068
Her super breath blew away the smoke.

34
00:01:57.069 --> 00:01:59.777
"Thank you, Rocket Girl," said the zookeeper.

35
00:01:59.786 --> 00:02:02.621
"Now we can see the animals and catch them!"

36
00:02:02.621 --> 00:02:09.806
As the zookeeper and police officers chased animals, Roxy picked up train cars.

37
00:02:09.806 --> 00:02:14.336
She put them back on the tracks, one by one.

38
00:02:14.336 --> 00:02:18.316
Detective Smith came over with a toucan.

39
00:02:18.316 --> 00:02:22.114
"I think we caught all the animals," he said.

40
00:02:22.114 --> 00:02:25.966
"Let's count them to make sure," said the zookeeper.

41
00:02:25.966 --> 00:02:29.683
The zookeeper counted the animals.

42
00:02:29.683 --> 00:02:31.796
He made notes on a clipboard.

43
00:02:31.796 --> 00:02:34.863
When he was done, he scratched his head.

44
00:02:34.863 --> 00:02:41.553
"One animal is still missing."

45
00:02:41.554 --> 00:02:44.636
Then he gasped.

46
00:02:44.636 --> 00:02:46.817
"Where's Blue Baboon?"

47
00:02:46.817 --> 00:02:50.243
Suddenly a loud sound shook the ground.

48
00:02:50.243 --> 00:02:53.940
"Wah-hu! Wah-hu!"

49
00:02:53.940 --> 00:02:55.695
The zookeeper frowned.

50
00:02:55.696 --> 00:02:58.389
"That sounds like Blue Baboon," he said.

51
00:02:58.389 --> 00:03:00.145
"But louder."

52
00:03:00.145 --> 00:03:03.791
Roxy nodded. "And bigger!"

53
00:03:03.791 --> 00:03:07.297
Stomp, stomp, stomp!

54
00:03:07.297 --> 00:03:09.234
The ground shook again.

55
00:03:09.234 --> 00:03:12.213
Everyone turned to look toward the sound.

56
00:03:12.213 --> 00:03:16.315
A huge cloud of chemical smoke moved across a farm field.

57
00:03:16.315 --> 00:03:19.675
Stomp, stomp, stomp!

58
00:03:19.676 --> 00:03:23.828
"There's something inside that chemical cloud," said Detective Smith.

59
00:03:23.829 --> 00:03:25.992
"Do you think it's . . . ?"

60
00:03:25.992 --> 00:03:28.694
The zookeeper dropped his clipboard.

61
00:03:28.694 --> 00:03:32.327
"Blue Baboon!"

